[node name="LookoutSite" type="Node4D"]
metadata/move_me = "Move (or turn) this node to move the whole Lookout: the Watchstone, Wren on its top, and the markers for the balloon's mooring and for the marsh (w +8) and the kata wood (w -8). The Watchstone stands at this node's height: put it on level ground. (Until 6 Oct the Lookout was a watchtower, lookout/lookout_tower_4d.gd; its copy is in chickenpen/.backup/2026-10-06_before_watchstone/.)"

